<title>FRANCE: UAP says no capital gain on Scor sale.</title>
<headline>UAP says no capital gain on Scor sale.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>UAP said on Thursday it will make no capital gain on the Scor shares that it sold.</p>
<p>&quot;For us, it will be an operation that will have no significant impact on our results,&quot; a spokesman said. Union des Assurances de Paris sold the shares for 197 francs each. It had put up for sale about 30 percent of Scor's capital.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
